      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": true,
      "char_count": 406,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.23244_p15_b2",
      "text": "\u2022 Convex Minimization: We fine-tune only the second layer weights (\u03b82) by minimizing the LCOALA objective. Since\nthe problem is convex, it can be solved to global optimality.\n",
